<![CDATA[<div><font face="arial" style="font-size: 12pt;">{!Lead.FirstName},</font><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><div><font face="arial">As promised, here is contact info for one of best lenders. Your next step is to complete the online application for financing. Once you are pre-approved, we will be ready to start building your portfolio together.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><b><br><a href="www.RidgeLendingGroup.com "><font color="#3366ff">Please use the link included in Caeli Ridge's contact info</font>&nbsp;</a></b>below and complete the application. Caeli's team will reach out to you within 48 hours of receiving your application to introduce themselves and help you obtain the financing approval.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div>Let me know as soon as you receive your approval for financing, and schedule a call with me using the link in my email as soon you are approved so that we can begin review properties as the become available.</div><div><br></div><div><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Thanks,</span></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Ashley&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div></div><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="font-family: Garamond, serif; color: rgb(31, 73, 125);">C</span><span style="font-family: Garamond, serif; color: rgb(68, 84, 106);">aeli&nbsp;<span class="il">Ridge</span></span><span style="font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif; color: rgb(68, 84, 106);"><u></u><u></u></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Garamond, serif; color: rgb(68, 8